Create a virtual env, activate this and then install all therequiremnets in that.


Need to install ollama pull qwen3:8b for this as the model is used this model.
steps to install this model is as followes :
    1. download the ollma form https://ollama.com/download/windows install this
    close the pycahrma and then open again and then run the command ollama --version

    pull the model :bu using this command (  ollama pull qwen3:8b   )
    Test this using ollama run qwen3:8b  ---> What is LangGraph?


2. pip install ollama
3. install python package langgraph , and langchain_ollama

